      "body": "Integrated all directed branch-support messages 1186, 1188, 1195, 1198, 1203, 1212, and 1217. Ledger 1247 now says formal Boolean deck-branch degree profile, not geometric codimension profile. The filtration and composition packets make the same correction. Generic complex geometry is restricted to degrees 1-3; degree 4 requires R0=0; degree 5 also requires C5=0. detG=0 alone is insufficient. On the affine-consistent rank-two locus I incorporated w^2+R=0, Nw=Cp, and Cp^2+N^2R=0 as a positive algebraic coefficient-plus-selector pair, while retaining the no-physical-current/no-relative-chain-transfer gate. The algebraic norm, V(2), Loewy, and product theorems are unchanged. No site build was run."
